document.addEventListener('submit',async e=>{if(['daily-photo-form','photo-program-form','timer-form','acc-form','video-category-form','rm-category-form'].includes(e.target.id)||e.target.getAttribute('id')?.startsWith('point-')||e.target.getAttribute('id')?.startsWith('nw-')||['privacy-accept-form','admin-account-delete-form','membership-event-delete-form'].includes(e.target.id))return;e.preventDefault();const f=e.target;if(f.id==='workout-copy-form')return;if(await handleAccountForm(f))return;if(!f.reportValidity())return;const data=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(f));const id=crypto.randomUUID();if(f.id==='comment-form'){await submitCommunityComment(f);return;}if(shared&&await sharedForm(f,data))return;if(f.id==='identity-link-form'){if(!coach||memberPreview)return;const at=data.record.indexOf(':');try{linkLegacyRecord(state,data.record.slice(0,at),data.record.slice(at+1),state.members.find(m=>m.id===data.memberId));save();close(true);render();toast('확인한 회원의 고유 ID에 연결했어요.')}catch(e){toast(e.message)}return}if(await rmForms(f,data))return;if(await extraForm(f,data))return;if(await serverForm(f,data))return;if(f.id==='rm-form'&&f.dataset.editId){const old=ownRms().find(r=>r.id===f.dataset.editId),movement=findRmMovement(rmCatalogue,data.movement);if(!old||!movement)return toast('본인의 1RM 종목을 확인해주세요.');if(old.source&&(old.date!==data.date||findRmMovement(rmCatalogue,old.movementId||old.movement)?.id!==movement.id))return toast('수업에서 연결된 동작과 날짜는 유지해주세요.');old.lbs=rmWeightLbs(f);old.date=data.date;old.movement=movement.name;old.movementId=movement.id;if(old.source){const record=state.records.find(r=>r.id===old.source&&isOwnRecord(r));if(record)record.lbs=old.lbs;}save();close(true);render();toast('1RM 기록을 수정했어요.');return;}if(f.id==='rm-form'){const movement=findRmMovement(rmCatalogue,data.movement);if(!movement?.active)return toast('현재 기록할 수 있는 종목을 선택해주세요.');state.rms.push({id,memberId:viewer.id,movementId:movement.id,movement:movement.name,lbs:rmWeightLbs(f),date:data.date});if(Array.isArray(state.rmSelections?.[viewer.id])&&!state.rmSelections[viewer.id].includes(movement.id))state.rmSelections[viewer.id].push(movement.id);save();close(true);render();return toast('새로운 도전을 1RM에 기록했어요.')}if(f.id==='record-form'){const w=workout(data.program,data.date),s=w.sections[+data.section];if(!s?.record)return toast('이 구간은 기록을 받지 않아요.');const old=state.records.find(r=>r.id===f.dataset.editId);if(old&&(!coach||memberPreview)&&!isOwnRecord(old))return toast('본인 기록만 수정할 수 있어요.');const r={...old,movement:s.movement||'',movements:s.movements||[],id:old?.id||id,name:coach?state.members.find(m=>m.id===data.memberId)?.name||'':state.name,memberId:coach?data.memberId:viewer.id,date:data.date,program:data.program,section:'S'+(+data.section+1),kind:s.kind,rank:old?.rank??state.rank,note:data.note,writer:coach?'admin':'member'};delete r.lbs;delete r.value;if(old?.session&&(old.program!==data.program||old.date!==data.date))delete r.session;delete r.result;try{Object.assign(r,recordInputPayload(s,f,old));}catch(e){return toast(e.message);}if(!r.name||(!r.lbs&&!r.value?.trim()))return toast('기록 내용을 입력해주세요.');if(old)state.records[state.records.indexOf(old)]=r;else state.records.push(r);state.rms=state.rms.filter(x=>x.source!==r.id);if(s.kind==='1RM'&&isOwnRecord(r)&&r.lbs&&findRmMovement(rmCatalogue,s.movement))state.rms.push({id,memberId:r.memberId,source:r.id,movement:s.movement,movementId:findRmMovement(rmCatalogue,s.movement).id,lbs:r.lbs,date:r.date});save();close(true);render();return toast('운동 기록을 저장했어요.')}if(f.id==='post-form'){if(!data.title.trim()||!data.body.trim())return;state.posts.unshift({id,category:data.category,title:data.title.trim(),body:data.body.trim(),author:state.name,authorId:viewer.id,date:today(),joined:[],comments:[]});save();close(true);render();return toast('새 이야기를 등록했어요.')}if(f.id==='comment-form'){if(!data.text.trim())return;const p=state.posts.find(p=>p.id===f.dataset.postId);p.comments.push({author:state.name,authorId:viewer.id,text:data.text.trim()});save();unsaved.track($('#modal-body'));return postModal(p.id)}if(f.id==='notice-form'&&viewer?.role==='admin'){if(!data.notice.trim())return;state.notice=data.notice.trim();save();close(true);render();return toast('공지 문구를 저장했어요.')}if(f.id==='signup-form'){state.members.push({id,name:data.name.trim(),status:'pending'});save();unsaved.track($('#modal-body'));modal('가입 신청 완료 · 체험','<p>관리자가 회원 확인 후 승인하는 단계입니다.</p><p class="field-hint">실제 가입은 진행되지 않았어요. 운영자 화면에서 체험 신청을 확인할 수 있습니다.</p><button class="btn primary full" data-action="close">확인</button>');return}});
